<title>USA: Premier Laser denies product infringes patent.</title>
<headline>Premier Laser denies product infringes patent.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier Laser Systems Inc Monday said it is confident that its Centauri Er:YAG, recently cleared by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration for dental hard-tissue applications, does not infringe any valid patents that may be held by American Dental Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it will defend its position vigorously in court if necessary.</p>
</text>
